[{:db/id "q-340455/selection/097d18320f205f20251d567b23f9d55a29132c283daa737419c8dc3674f708b3" :answer/id #uuid "0097c7c0-21aa-5993-9c98-b4a1bd9f3827" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)+\\frac{1}{32}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(16x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340455/selection/9ba3d02e5a6bd31b7aa071079eab430eec1e478f242e8bc545cef986f288a8aa" :answer/id #uuid "abb4d103-7f4d-5ba4-83a5-92691c37dbad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)+\\frac{1}{11}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340455/selection/b20c1dfccd559751d73214d2e7d29586ee04e3fb68eb4c36e1e7f35dda425d8d" :answer/id #uuid "a19089df-e070-5350-bd72-06afbcb2c3af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)-\\frac{1}{32}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(16x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340455/selection/c9d09d12f52f8b5983c8508ac65a5a15f0496d9b39a8fc2ea0e1397f9125c772" :answer/id #uuid "b681fdb6-2013-541d-957a-500a5829b143" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)+\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(16x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340455/selection/971ca1b83a9d10cad18fe7eda200f0ad02085e7f6fb0c32509de1e9c98a55094" :answer/id #uuid "91d1c67e-e753-5392-b3f7-86f5d4678cbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)-\\frac{1}{32}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(16x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340455/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a56b632-ccc2-5065-94cb-c2b624fcaa52" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-340455/selection/097d18320f205f20251d567b23f9d55a29132c283daa737419c8dc3674f708b3" :answer-field/choices ["q-340455/selection/097d18320f205f20251d567b23f9d55a29132c283daa737419c8dc3674f708b3" "q-340455/selection/9ba3d02e5a6bd31b7aa071079eab430eec1e478f242e8bc545cef986f288a8aa" "q-340455/selection/b20c1dfccd559751d73214d2e7d29586ee04e3fb68eb4c36e1e7f35dda425d8d" "q-340455/selection/c9d09d12f52f8b5983c8508ac65a5a15f0496d9b39a8fc2ea0e1397f9125c772" "q-340455/selection/971ca1b83a9d10cad18fe7eda200f0ad02085e7f6fb0c32509de1e9c98a55094"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340455" :question/id #uuid "8374af53-3fd1-5a1e-a02f-8b37b9c795a8" :question/math-academy-id "q-340455" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the sum and difference formulas for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\beta  \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta -\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\beta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding these equations, we get the following product-to-sum identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta  \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x) & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x-5x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x+5x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(16x)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(16x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)+\\frac{1}{32}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(16x)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-340455/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3cb2fcb-3457-5a89-8968-6c0f2c2cfa83"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340455"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453/selection/e42b9e992e00bb5e3fad0dbcefe64e18b954a9bbb817b2f863684893d5877296" :answer/id #uuid "ab406d2b-7e51-5d18-9949-8553dc59caf4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)+\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453/selection/9d4718e1bc0b6374dd76052bb0743967dd7622e78e7c360ec4e17209b0614a12" :answer/id #uuid "9fa97653-8da3-5285-be86-969aa79f069f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)+\\frac{1}{20}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453/selection/ad46dd88a632b85b68dba7ac15dac1c7015b9733e22cfdd9b38e05ef9583f275" :answer/id #uuid "165c128f-9cbb-5f95-87c1-33f3d70813fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)-\\frac{1}{20}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453/selection/c59bd3ca2b55187197efcc0e8d3ce88c77d6193d629c9101d15890d24ffded27" :answer/id #uuid "8094c961-a6be-56e1-803c-dae7db92767a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)-\\frac{1}{20}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453/selection/846ab55d9e18eb8e8f801be84fcc64335d03791aae16a416fde86c6980006bb7" :answer/id #uuid "a5bd0b00-dd67-5b6b-801d-26023af43170" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)+\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "25f42b63-0055-52f6-a90b-b4a0474278ed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-340453/selection/9d4718e1bc0b6374dd76052bb0743967dd7622e78e7c360ec4e17209b0614a12" :answer-field/choices ["q-340453/selection/e42b9e992e00bb5e3fad0dbcefe64e18b954a9bbb817b2f863684893d5877296" "q-340453/selection/9d4718e1bc0b6374dd76052bb0743967dd7622e78e7c360ec4e17209b0614a12" "q-340453/selection/ad46dd88a632b85b68dba7ac15dac1c7015b9733e22cfdd9b38e05ef9583f275" "q-340453/selection/c59bd3ca2b55187197efcc0e8d3ce88c77d6193d629c9101d15890d24ffded27" "q-340453/selection/846ab55d9e18eb8e8f801be84fcc64335d03791aae16a416fde86c6980006bb7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340453" :question/id #uuid "32d0dc78-90e3-5577-ab19-fdf207b9d8ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-340453" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the sum and difference formulas for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\beta  \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta -\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\beta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding these equations, we get the following product-to-sum identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta  \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x) & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x-4x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x+4x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(10x)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(10x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)+\\frac{1}{20}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(10x)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-340453/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3cb2fcb-3457-5a89-8968-6c0f2c2cfa83"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340453"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340471/field-1/1221476fbc43e973cfe3bfa43b136cbf7481dfbc3e4dfdeca82c2c2d63be61e7" :answer/id #uuid "c81d56e5-0350-5377-afba-2325b9e2fac8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340471/field-1/2faeea9c9eedefeae671c807b51ede422449e2976700bcbd604b58e50a79be38" :answer/id #uuid "352ca981-1a0f-5ad3-a45c-0f1f1e1d7ce8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340471/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "dd5b1d4b-f203-5eff-8281-f6a7d2901745" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-340471/field-1/1221476fbc43e973cfe3bfa43b136cbf7481dfbc3e4dfdeca82c2c2d63be61e7" :answer-field/choices ["q-340471/field-1/1221476fbc43e973cfe3bfa43b136cbf7481dfbc3e4dfdeca82c2c2d63be61e7" "q-340471/field-1/2faeea9c9eedefeae671c807b51ede422449e2976700bcbd604b58e50a79be38"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340471" :question/id #uuid "8e0ba3f4-6529-5624-ad59-b0145e98c9e4" :question/math-academy-id "q-340471" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the sum and difference formulas for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\beta  \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta -\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\beta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding these equations, we get the following product-to-sum identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta  \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\alpha \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\beta  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha -\\beta )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\alpha +\\beta ))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x) & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-4x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+4x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-3x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)]}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0))+\\frac{1}{10}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(-1-0)+\\frac{1}{10}(1-0) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{15}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-340471/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3cb2fcb-3457-5a89-8968-6c0f2c2cfa83"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340471"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340456/selection/f1228e3877f285a8da0254398cc6a569cb8c8a01658cf7e3f02bd0257cbb0db4" :answer/id #uuid "29ca6cad-0b9a-5